From: b1air <dimazzzzz342@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:42:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Add special_workspace: a workspace called up over the
 others

Hyprland's special workspace. `special_workspace toggle|show|hide` brings
a workspace of its own, named "special", up over the one in front of you,
and puts it away again; the one beneath stays drawn, dimmed, and its
floating windows are hidden while it is covered. Windows go to it with
`move container to workspace special`. Showing it follows the focused
screen. No slide or fade either way.

It is called up, never stepped to: workspace next/prev, next_on_output and
the workspace swipe all pass it by.
